button: [Setup guide](https://geysermc.org/wiki/geyser/setup/)

---

With Minecraft: Bedrock Edition 26.60 (planned for October 27th, 2026), Bedrock clients will stop connecting over RakNet.
Every Geyser server has to switch to NetherNet before then, or Bedrock players won't be able to join.

Please follow the setup guide linked below to find instructions for configuring NetherNet.
